and Feedback added feedbackStore — the documented "single seam A7 page prompts widen (register their store +
ViewModel)". No feature page was touched; the host was registered in TeslaSyncApplication alongside the
sibling admin hosts.

GATE PATH NOTE: Gradle project path is ':android' (settings.gradle.kts maps ':android' -> app/); the prompt
snippet's ':app:' is the same module. Kotlin daemon heap raised to 6g via '-Pkotlin.daemon.jvmargs=-Xmx6g'
(single-quoted on PowerShell so the dotted -P arg is one token; CLI only, no file edits) — matching the
ApiLogsPage precedent.

POLL NOTE: the web 1 s refetchInterval (refetchIntervalInBackground:false) is a render-layer cadence, so the
foreground poll is a LaunchedEffect(selection) in the screen that calls viewModel.refreshLive() every 1000 ms
while a vehicle is selected + the screen is in composition; it cancels on navigation away (the native analogue
of pausing in a background tab). The >2 min staleness is surfaced via the shared FreshnessIndicator fed by the
live feed's fetchedAt (ADR-013).

